OL,3,GNEWSADrivers crashing into railway     
OL,4,Abridges delaying passengers by 11 days 
OL,5,Aa year                                 
OL,7,FDrivers crashing into railway bridges  
OL,8,Fare costing passengers more than 11    
OL,9,Fdays' worth of delays every year,      
OL,10,FNetwork Rail has said.                 
OL,12,FA total of 72 incidents were recorded  
OL,13,Ffrom April 2025 to March 2026 across   
OL,14,FWales, with Aberystwyth Road bridge in 
OL,15,FCaersws, Powys, being the worst        
OL,16,Faffected.                              
OL,18,FThe strikes caused 271 hours of        
OL,19,Fdisruption to services and cost more   
OL,20,Fthan #600,000 in delays, cancellations 
OL,21,Fand repairs.                           
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
