OL,3,GNEWSADrivers crashing into railway     
OL,4,Abridges delaying passengers by 11 days 
OL,5,Aa year                                 
OL,7,FNetwork Rail said it was urging drivers
OL,8,Fto check their vehicle heights before  
OL,9,Ftravelling, saying it could prevent    
OL,10,Fpotentially dangerous and costly       
OL,11,Fcrashes.                               
